  "description": "Through an introduction from a college senior, rookie lyricist Baek Ji-Seok lands a job at an A&R company and is tasked with writing lyrics for famous singer Cha Do-Yun's new song. But in the process, he gets his lyrics stolen and finds himself facing the threat of being sued instead...\n\nWhen Ji-Seok is pushed to the edge of a cliff, the one extending a hand of salvation is none other than Cha Do-Yun?!\n\n*“Why are you helping me?”*\n\nA cohabitation begins with the inscrutable Do-Yun. Will Ji-Seok manage to write the lyrics safely?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
